{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo covers the first chapter, introducing both the world and the main character, leading up to his first communication from the rebels \u2014 the moment our adventure begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS BROKEN_SYSTEM?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken_System is a puzzle-adventure game set in a dystopian future where everything and everyone is controlled by a massive corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/extras/bbd71ba89fde051964f8ae88f9f41b60.avif?t=1758134187\" data-has-big width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO ARE YOU?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you will impersonate an employee working for this company--until one day, you receive a message from a rebel group asking for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/extras/65906d45cc75fcfdcb712e4d5aacb291.avif?t=1758134187\" width=1560 height=627 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to fix this broken system?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016710?t=1758134187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/1459cf10fc72fe4b6d7770dabfe6f413844ba93f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758134187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/b1c99a4b64814a2b039109896e02c5f5fec6f7db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758134187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/b1c99a4b64814a2b039109896e02c5f5fec6f7db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758134187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo covers the first chapter, introducing both the world and the main character, leading up to his first communication from the rebels \u2014 the moment our adventure begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS BROKEN_SYSTEM?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken_System is a puzzle-adventure game set in a dystopian future where everything and everyone is controlled by a massive corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/extras/bbd71ba89fde051964f8ae88f9f41b60.avif?t=1758134187\" data-has-big width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO ARE YOU?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you will impersonate an employee working for this company--until one day, you receive a message from a rebel group asking for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/extras/65906d45cc75fcfdcb712e4d5aacb291.avif?t=1758134187\" width=1560 height=627 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to fix this broken system?</p>","developers":["Lamp","Strausste"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3992380","name":"Broken_System"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016710/f69238a482fc02f2ae0ce3342620d4625b2fb602/header.jpg?t=1758134187","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5500u<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graph